## Third-party word lists

Tournament word lists and definitions bundled with this application are sourced
from open archives (see `docs/technical_design.md` § Dictionary). Those assets
may be subject to additional terms from their publishers (e.g. Collins /
HarperCollins for CSW lists). Review `assets/dictionaries/NOTICE` (added when
assets are vendored) before redistributing dictionary data commercially.
